and I was like
"God really got up to his

00:09:08.447 --> 00:09:10.449
tricks today with this traffic."

00:09:10.449 --> 00:09:13.152
And that just kind of came out
of my mouth, and I was like,

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:14.953
oh, so now
when anything good or bad

00:09:14.953 --> 00:09:16.922
happens to me,
that's blind faith,

00:09:16.922 --> 00:09:18.724
that's God just getting up
to his little tricks.

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:19.758
-Yeah.

00:09:19.758 --> 00:09:21.427
-And so I wrote
a song about that.

00:09:21.427 --> 00:09:23.962
It's in the -- it's in the style
of like a musical theater,

00:09:23.962 --> 00:09:25.531
Andrew Lloyd Webber.

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:27.867
And "Lube For the Sleigh"
is a disco song, by the way.

00:09:27.867 --> 00:09:29.935
I know that that's --
that seemed like --

00:09:29.935 --> 00:09:31.403
-I think,
if given the choice,

00:09:31.403 --> 00:09:33.839
we would have got that right.
-Right, right, right, exactly.

00:09:33.839 --> 00:09:34.974
You're coming on my podcast.
-I am.

00:09:34.974 --> 00:09:35.975
So you mentioned Bowen.

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:37.376
You and Bowen Yang have a --

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:38.711
How long have you --
how many episodes

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:39.745
have you done
of "Las Culturistas?"

00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:41.647
-Oh, God.
We're coming up on 400 episodes.

00:09:41.647 --> 00:09:42.982
-That is amazing.

00:09:42.982 --> 00:09:44.249
-Yeah.
-Congratulations.

00:09:44.249 --> 00:09:45.618
That's really, really cool.
-Thank you.

00:09:45.618 --> 00:09:48.888
And you know what's funny?
Like, we started it in 2016

00:09:48.888 --> 00:09:50.989
and we thought we were
so late on podcasts.

00:09:50.989 --> 00:09:52.958
This is so lame.
We were like, this sucks.

00:09:52.958 --> 00:09:54.927
We're doing a podcast now.
It's like over.

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:57.362
Now, everyone was --
I was, you know, Hillary,

00:09:57.362 --> 00:09:59.431
Hillary's got a pod.

00:09:59.431 --> 00:10:00.532
-But, yeah, you guys were like

00:10:00.532 --> 00:10:01.901
front runners on podcasts.
Congratulations.

00:10:01.901 --> 00:10:03.302
-Which we never would have
known,

00:10:03.302 --> 00:10:06.371
and by the way, it's a big deal
for you booking our pod

00:10:06.371 --> 00:10:07.673
because we don't allow
straight men on.

00:10:07.673 --> 00:10:10.676
-Really?
-No, it's you and Will Ferrell,

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:12.377
and we had to let him on
because he begged.

00:10:12.377 --> 00:10:13.812
-Oh, wow.
-It was pathetic

00:10:13.812 --> 00:10:17.083
-Based on this, I think I know
how to talk like gay men.

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.083
I'd be like, "What's up, bro?
How's it going?"

00:10:18.083 --> 00:10:19.418
Like I said...

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:20.686
[ Laughter ]

00:10:20.686 --> 00:10:22.421
All of a sudden
I get in your DMs.

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.156
-Ding, ding, ding.

00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:25.658
Hey, what a delight
to have you here.

00:10:25.658 --> 00:10:28.293
Congrats on the --.
I can't wait to do your podcast.

00:10:28.293 --> 00:10:29.695
-Matt Rogers, everybody,

00:10:29.695 --> 00:10:31.097
"Have You Heard
It's Christmas?" out now.

00:10:31.097 --> 00:10:32.264
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night.

